text: ['({T}: Add {B}.)', '({T}: Add {G}.)', '({T}: Add {R}.)', '({T}: Add {U}.)', '({T}: Add {W}.)', "Activated abilities of creatures can't be activated.", 'All Forests are 1/1 creatures that are still lands.', "An opponent chooses one —\n• You draw three cards at the beginning of the next turn's upkeep.\n• You search your library for a card, put that card into your hand, then shuffle.", 'Artifacts, creatures, and lands your opponents control enter the battlefield tapped.', "As Primal Clay enters the battlefield, it becomes your choice of a 3/3 artifact creature, a 2/2 artifact creature with flying, or a 1/6 Wall artifact creature with defender in addition to its other types. (A creature with defender can't attack.)", "At the beginning of each player's draw step, if Howling Mine is untapped, that player draws an additional card.", "At the beginning of each player's draw step, that player puts the cards in their hand on the bottom of their library in any order, then draws that many cards.", 'At the beginning of the end step, if no creatures are on the battlefield, sacrifice Pestilence.\n{B}: Pestilence deals 1 damage to each creature and each player.', "At the beginning of your upkeep, destroy all artifacts and enchantments. They can't be regenerated.", 'Attacking creatures you control get +1/+0.', "Black creatures can't attack or block.", 'Black spells you cast cost {B} more to cast.', 'Blaze deals X damage to any target.', "Bog Rats can't be blocked by Walls.", 'Change the target of target spell with a single target.', 'Charcoal Diamond enters the battlefield tapped.\n{T}: Add {B}.', 'Choose one —\n• Target player gains 3 life.\n• Prevent the next 3 damage that would be dealt to any target this turn.', 'Counter target creature spell.', "Counter target spell unless its controller pays {X}. If that player doesn't, they tap all lands with mana abilities they control and lose all unspent mana.", "Counter target spell with mana value X. (For example, if that spell's mana cost is {3}{U}{U}, X is 5.)", 'Counter target spell.', "Counter target spell. If an artifact or creature spell is countered this way, put that card onto the battlefield under your control instead of into its owner's graveyard.", "Counter target spell. If that spell is countered this way, put it on top of its owner's library instead of into that player's graveyard.", 'Create four 1/1 white Citizen creature tokens.', "Creatures can't be the targets of spells.", "Creatures with power 3 or greater don't untap during their controllers' untap steps.", 'Creatures you control get +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'Creatures you control have haste. (They can attack and {T} as soon as they come under your control.)', "Creatures you control have vigilance. (Attacking doesn't cause them to tap.)", "Defender (This creature can't attack.)", "Defender (This creature can't attack.)\nFlying", "Defender (This creature can't attack.)\nFlying\nSunweb can't block creatures with power 2 or less.", "Defender (This creature can't attack.)\n{R}: Wall of Fire gets +1/+0 until end of turn.", "Defender, flying (This creature can't attack, and it can block creatures with flying.)", 'Destroy all Islands.', 'Destroy all Plains.', "Destroy all artifacts, creatures, and lands. They can't be regenerated.", "Destroy all artifacts. They can't be regenerated.", "Destroy all creatures. They can't be regenerated.", 'Destroy all enchantments.', "Destroy all green creatures. They can't be regenerated.", 'Destroy all lands.', 'Destroy target artifact or enchantment.', "Destroy target artifact or land. It can't be regenerated.", 'Destroy target artifact, enchantment, or land.', 'Destroy target artifact.', "Destroy target creature that was dealt damage this turn. It can't be regenerated.", "Destroy target creature with power 4 or greater. It can't be regenerated.", "Destroy target creature. It can't be regenerated. Its controller reveals cards from the top of their library until they reveal a creature card. The player puts that card onto the battlefield, then shuffles all other cards revealed this way into their library.", 'Destroy target land.', "Destroy target nonartifact, nonblack creature. It can't be regenerated.", 'Discard X cards, then return a card from your graveyard to your hand for each card discarded this way. Exile Recall.', 'Draw four cards. You lose half your life, rounded up.', 'Draw three cards, then put two cards from your hand both on top of your library or both on the bottom of your library.', 'Dry Spell deals 1 damage to each creature and each player.', 'Dwarven Ruins enters the battlefield tapped.\n{T}: Add {R}.\n{T}, Sacrifice Dwarven Ruins: Add {R}{R}.', "Each creature you control can't be blocked by more than one creature.", 'Each player creates a 1/1 green Cat creature token for each untapped Forest they control.', 'Each player draws X cards.', 'Each player draws a card for each creature card in their graveyard.', 'Each player may bid life for control of target creature. You start the bidding with a bid of 0. In turn order, each player may top the high bid. The bidding ends if the high bid stands. The high bidder loses life equal to the high bid and gains control of the creature. (This effect lasts indefinitely.)', "Each player may play an additional land during each of their turns.\nWhenever a land is tapped for mana, return it to its owner's hand.", "Each player sacrifices the creature they control with the highest mana value unless they pay that creature's mana cost. If two or more creatures a player controls are tied for highest, that player chooses one.", 'Each player shuffles their hand and graveyard into their library. You exile the top ten cards of your library. Then each player draws up to seven cards.', 'Earthquake deals X damage to each creature without flying and each player.', 'Ebon Stronghold enters the battlefield tapped.\n{T}: Add {B}.\n{T}, Sacrifice Ebon Stronghold: Add {B}{B}.', "Elven Riders can't be blocked except by Walls and/or creatures with flying.", "Enchant Wall\nEnchanted Wall can attack as though it didn't have defender.", 'Enchant creature\nAll creatures able to block enchanted creature do so.', "Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature can't attack or block.", 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +1/+5.', 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+2.', 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +3/+3.', 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +4/+0.', 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature has flying.', "Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature has mountainwalk. (It can't be blocked as long as defending player controls a Mountain.)", "Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature has swampwalk. (It can't be blocked as long as defending player controls a Swamp.)", 'Enchant creature\nPrevent all combat damage that would be dealt to and dealt by enchanted creature.', "Enchant creature\nWhen Abduction enters the battlefield, untap enchanted creature.\nYou control enchanted creature.\nWhen enchanted creature dies, return that card to the battlefield under its owner's control.", 'Enchant creature\n{R}: Enchanted creature gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', 'Enchant creature (Target a creature as you cast this. This card enters the battlefield attached to that creature.)\nEnchanted creature gets -2/-2.', "Enchant creature (Target a creature as you cast this. This card enters the battlefield attached to that creature.)\nEnchanted creature has fear. (It can't be blocked except by artifact creatures and/or black creatures.)", 'Enchant creature (Target a creature as you cast this. This card enters the battlefield attached to that creature.)\nWhenever enchanted creature deals damage, you gain that much life.', "Enchant creature (Target a creature as you cast this. This card enters the battlefield attached to that creature.)\n{G}: Regenerate enchanted creature. (The next time that creature would be destroyed this turn, it isn't. Instead tap it, remove all damage from it, and remove it from combat.)", 'Enchant land\nAs Phantasmal Terrain enters the battlefield, choose a basic land type.\nEnchanted land is the chosen type.', 'Enchant land\nWhen enchanted land becomes tapped, destroy it.', "Enchant land\nWhenever enchanted land becomes tapped, Psychic Venom deals 2 damage to that land's controller.", 'Enchant land\nWhenever enchanted land is tapped for mana, its controller adds an additional {G}.', 'Enchant land\nYou control enchanted land.', 'Exile target nonwhite attacking creature. You gain life equal to its toughness.', "Fear (This creature can't be blocked except by artifact creatures and/or black creatures.)", 'Fire Diamond enters the battlefield tapped.\n{T}: Add {R}.', 'First strike', 'First strike (This creature deals combat damage before creatures without first strike.)', 'First strike; reach (This creature can block creatures with flying.)', 'Flying', "Flying\nMenace (This creature can't be blocked except by two or more creatures.)", 'Flying\nPay 1 life: Regenerate Mischievous Poltergeist.', 'Flying\nSacrifice Daraja Griffin: Destroy target black creature.', 'Flying\nSacrifice Unyaro Griffin: Counter target red instant or sorcery spell.', 'Flying\nSacrifice a creature: Fallen Angel gets +2/+1 until end of turn.', 'Flying\nWhen Sage Owl enters the battlefield, look at the top four cards of your library, then put them back in any order.', 'Flying\nWhenever Abyssal Specter deals damage to a player, that player discards a card.', 'Flying\nWhenever Sibilant Spirit attacks, defending player may draw a card.', 'Flying\n{1}{U}{U}: Target creature gains flying until end of turn.', 'Flying\n{1}{W}: Mesa Falcon gets +0/+1 until end of turn.', 'Flying\n{1}{W}: Pearl Dragon gets +0/+1 until end of turn.', 'Flying\n{R}: Spitting Drake gets +1/+0 until end of turn. Activate only once each turn.', 'Flying\n{T}: Add one mana of any color.', 'Flying\n{X}, {T}: Crimson Hellkite deals X damage to target creature. Spend only red mana on X.', "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)\nNightmare's power and toughness are each equal to the number of Swamps you control.", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)\nWhen Fog Elemental attacks or blocks, sacrifice it at end of combat.", 'Flying, first strike', 'Flying, haste', 'Flying, vigilance', "Forestwalk (This creature can't be blocked as long as defending player controls a Forest.)", "Forestwalk (This creature can't be blocked as long as defending player controls a Forest.)\n{1}{G}{G}: Target creature gains forestwalk until end of turn.", 'Hammer of Bogardan deals 3 damage to any target.\n{2}{R}{R}{R}: Return Hammer of Bogardan from your graveyard to your hand. Activate only during your upkeep.', 'Haste', 'Haste (This creature can attack and {T} as soon as it comes under your control.)', 'Havenwood Battleground enters the battlefield tapped.\n{T}: Add {G}.\n{T}, Sacrifice Havenwood Battleground: Add {G}{G}.', "Hulking Cyclops can't block.", 'Hurricane deals X damage to each creature with flying and each player.', "If Gravebane Zombie would die, put Gravebane Zombie on top of its owner's library instead.", "If the difference between your life total and target player's life total is 5 or less, exchange life totals with that player.", "If you would draw a card, return a card from your graveyard to your hand instead. If you can't, you lose the game.\nIf a card would be put into your graveyard from anywhere, exile that card instead.", 'Inferno deals 6 damage to each creature and each player.', "Islandwalk (This creature can't be blocked as long as defending player controls an Island.)", "Islandwalk (This creature can't be blocked as long as defending player controls an Island.)\n{G}: Regenerate River Boa.", "Lands you control are Plains.\nNonland permanents you control are white. The same is true for spells you control and nonland cards you own that aren't on the battlefield.\nYou may spend white mana as though it were mana of any color. You may spend other mana only as though it were colorless mana.", 'Lightning Blast deals 4 damage to any target.', "Look at target opponent's hand and choose a card from it. Put that card on top of that player's library.", "Look at target player's hand and choose X cards from it. That player discards those cards.", "Look at target player's hand and choose two cards from it. Put them on top of that player's library in any order.", 'Look at the top seven cards of your library. Put two of them into your hand and the rest into your graveyard.', 'Marble Diamond enters the battlefield tapped.\n{T}: Add {W}.', "Maro's power and toughness are each equal to the number of cards in your hand.", 'Moss Diamond enters the battlefield tapped.\n{T}: Add {G}.', "Mountainwalk (This creature can't be blocked as long as defending player controls a Mountain.)", "Non-Eye creatures you control can't attack.\nEvil Eye of Orms-by-Gore can't be blocked except by Walls.", 'Other Goblins get +1/+1 and have mountainwalk.', "Other Merfolk get +1/+1 and have islandwalk. (They can't be blocked as long as defending player controls an Island.)", 'Other Zombie creatures have swampwalk. (They can\'t be blocked as long as defending player controls a Swamp.)\nOther Zombies have "{B}: Regenerate this permanent."', 'Pay 1 life: Prevent the next 1 damage that would be dealt to Ethereal Champion this turn.', "Phantom Warrior can't be blocked.", "Players play with their hands revealed.\nIf a player would draw a card, they reveal it instead. Then any other player may pay 2 life. If a player does, put that card into its owner's graveyard. Otherwise, that player draws a card.", 'Prevent all combat damage that would be dealt this turn.', 'Prevent the next 5 damage that would be dealt this turn to any number of targets, divided as you choose.', "Put target creature card from an opponent's graveyard onto the battlefield under your control.", "Put target land on top of its owner's library.", 'Pyrotechnics deals 4 damage divided as you choose among any number of targets.', 'Reach (This creature can block creatures with flying.)', 'Red spells cost {2} more to cast.', 'Return target card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'Return target creature card from your graveyard to your hand.', "Return target creature to its owner's hand.", 'Return target instant or sorcery card from your graveyard to your hand.', "Return target permanent to its owner's hand.", 'Reveal the first card you draw each turn. Whenever you reveal a basic land card this way, draw a card.', 'Ruins of Trokair enters the battlefield tapped.\n{T}: Add {W}.\n{T}, Sacrifice Ruins of Trokair: Add {W}{W}.', 'Sacrifice Blood Pet: Add {B}.', 'Sacrifice Resistance Fighter: Prevent all combat damage target creature would deal this turn.', 'Sacrifice a creature: Add {C}{C}.', "Sea Monster can't attack unless defending player controls an Island.", 'Search your library and graveyard for five cards and exile the rest. Put the chosen cards on top of your library in any order. You lose half your life, rounded up.', 'Search your library for a basic land card, put that card onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', 'Search your library for a basic land card, put that card onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', 'Search your library for a card, then shuffle and put that card on top. You lose 2 life.', 'Search your library for a creature card, reveal it, then shuffle and put the card on top.', 'Search your library for an artifact or enchantment card, reveal it, then shuffle and put that card on top.', 'Search your library for an instant or sorcery card, reveal it, then shuffle and put that card on top.', 'Shock deals 2 damage to any target.', 'Sky Diamond enters the battlefield tapped.\n{T}: Add {U}.', 'Spitting Earth deals damage to target creature equal to the number of Mountains you control.', "Stalking Tiger can't be blocked by more than one creature.", 'Svyelunite Temple enters the battlefield tapped.\n{T}: Add {U}.\n{T}, Sacrifice Svyelunite Temple: Add {U}{U}.', "Swampwalk (This creature can't be blocked as long as defending player controls a Swamp.)", 'Syphon Soul deals 2 damage to each other player. You gain life equal to the damage dealt this way.', "Take an extra turn after this one. At the beginning of that turn's end step, you lose the game.", 'Tap all lands target player controls and that player loses all unspent mana.', 'Tap up to three target creatures without flying.', 'Target creature gets +3/+3 and gains first strike until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets +3/+3 until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets +X/+0 until end of turn.', 'Target opponent discards a card at random, then discards a card.', 'Target opponent reveals their hand. You choose a card from it. That player discards that card.', 'Target player discards two cards, then draws as many cards as they discarded this way.', 'Target player draws two cards.', 'Target player gains X life.', 'Target player untaps all basic lands they control.', 'The next time a source of your choice would deal damage to you this turn, prevent that damage. You gain life equal to the damage prevented this way.', 'Tremor deals 1 damage to each creature without flying.', "Uktabi Wildcats's power and toughness are each equal to the number of Forests you control.\n{G}, Sacrifice a Forest: Regenerate Uktabi Wildcats.", 'Untap all creatures that attacked this turn. After this main phase, there is an additional combat phase followed by an additional main phase.', 'Untap all creatures you control.', 'Untapped creatures you control get +0/+2.', 'Vertigo deals 2 damage to target creature with flying. That creature loses flying until end of turn.', 'Vigilance', 'Volcanic Geyser deals X damage to any target.', 'When Balduvian Horde enters the battlefield, sacrifice it unless you discard a card at random.', 'When Goblin Recruiter enters the battlefield, search your library for any number of Goblin cards, reveal them, then shuffle and put those cards on top in any order.', 'When Gravedigger enters the battlefield, you may return target creature card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'When Hecatomb enters the battlefield, sacrifice Hecatomb unless you sacrifice four creatures.\nTap an untapped Swamp you control: Hecatomb deals 1 damage to any target.', 'When Hidden Horror enters the battlefield, sacrifice it unless you discard a creature card.', 'When Kjeldoran Dead enters the battlefield, sacrifice a creature.\n{B}: Regenerate Kjeldoran Dead.', 'When Sengir Autocrat enters the battlefield, create three 0/1 black Serf creature tokens.\nWhen Sengir Autocrat leaves the battlefield, exile all Serf tokens.', 'When Staunch Defenders enters the battlefield, you gain 4 life.', 'When Uktabi Orangutan enters the battlefield, destroy target artifact.', 'When Venerable Monk enters the battlefield, you gain 2 life.', 'Whenever City of Brass becomes tapped, it deals 1 damage to you.\n{T}: Add one mana of any color.', 'Whenever Goblin Elite Infantry blocks or becomes blocked, it gets -1/-1 until end of turn.', "Whenever Lead Golem attacks, it doesn't untap during its controller's next untap step.", 'Whenever Thicket Basilisk blocks or becomes blocked by a non-Wall creature, destroy that creature at end of combat.', 'Whenever a creature dies, you may pay {1}. If you do, you gain 1 life.', 'Whenever a creature enters the battlefield, Aether Flash deals 2 damage to it.', "Whenever a land enters the battlefield, Ankh of Mishra deals 2 damage to that land's controller.", "Whenever a land is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, Dingus Egg deals 2 damage to that land's controller.", 'Whenever a player casts a black spell, you may pay {1}. If you do, you gain 1 life.', 'Whenever a player casts a blue spell, you may pay {1}. If you do, you gain 1 life.', 'Whenever a player casts a green spell, you may pay {1}. If